153
00:11:40,678 --> 00:11:42,918
Don't stop until the gate is wide open!

154
00:11:43,138 --> 00:11:44,258
Wait, wait, wait!

155
00:11:44,338 --> 00:11:45,058
Hold on!

156
00:11:45,178 --> 00:11:45,898
