Push the gate!

159
00:11:49,458 --> 00:11:51,078
No!

160
00:11:55,178 --> 00:11:56,018
Impossible!

161
00:11:56,478 --> 00:11:57,758
The gates are opening!

162
00:11:58,198 --> 00:11:59,898
What the hell is Oimo doing?

163
00:12:01,278 --> 00:12:01,658
Umaar!

164
00:12:14,078 --> 00:12:16,218
That reached the gate!

165
00:12:16,218 --> 00:12:46,198
Let's go.

166
00:12:46,218 --> 00:13:05,278
Oh, hey, hey!

167
00:13:10,278 --> 00:13:13,458
There's no way. Is that a sea train?

168
00:13:13,458 --> 00:13:14,638
