173
00:13:37,178 --> 00:13:39,158
What are they trying to do, jump the fence?

174
00:13:39,158 --> 00:14:04,078
Hurry! Close the gate! We can't let them through!

175
00:14:04,078 --> 00:14:06,518
Come on! Get those doors shut!

176
00:14:20,418 --> 00:14:21,298
Hey, Granny!

177
00:14:21,658 --> 00:14:22,838
Yeah? What is it?

178
00:14:23,058 --> 00:14:27,198
There's been a change of plans. I need you to give me as much speed as you got, okay?

179
00:14:27,198 --> 00:14:30,238
Roger, please. Roger!

180
00:14:30,638 --> 00:14:38,038
It seems we've had to switch up our plans a little. Your green-haired samurai friend says you should all find something to hold on to. Better hurry!

181
00:14:39,318 --> 00:14:41,098
Find something to hold on to?

182
00:14:41,418 --> 00:14:42,058
