183
00:14:42,058 --> 00:14:45,858
Hey, Mosfer Brains! What's going on out here?

184
00:14:47,838 --> 00:14:50,778
They, uh, they closed the main gate.

185
00:14:51,278 --> 00:14:52,138
Hey, what?

186
