190
00:15:04,018 --> 00:15:05,158
All right, Zoro!

191
00:15:05,158 --> 00:15:13,658
Hey, Frogs! See fence? Smash!

192
00:15:13,758 --> 00:15:14,298
What?

193
00:15:16,938 --> 00:15:18,038
Get out!

194
00:15:21,098 --> 00:15:21,798
