224
00:22:57,613 --> 00:23:01,733
Then again, thanks to Luffy, the marine forces are scattered all over the island.

225
00:23:01,813 --> 00:23:05,593
Good. More for me. I'm not gonna let Luffy have all the fun.

226
00:23:05,733 --> 00:23:10,693
On the next, One Piece, catch up with Luffy, the Straw Hat's all-out battle.

227
00:23:10,693 --> 00:23:12,893
